{"id":"434759","name":"萝卜丝虾皮香菜粉丝汤","author":"hb俗人","authorId":"10224823","desc":"","cover":"images/434759/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"一截"},{"name":"葱","amount":"一截"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"两棵"},{"name":"粉丝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白萝卜切丝，葱切丝，香菜切小段。","img":"images/434759/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅中放入适量清水，放入白萝卜丝，葱丝。","img":"images/434759/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入适量虾皮，大火烧开。","img":"images/434759/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入粉丝烧开，粉丝变透明，关火。","img":"images/434759/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"撒上香菜，淋适量香油。","img":"images/434759/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/434759/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}